/image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/csOKLKbiizE0mySOcim2gUugNHt.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2023-10-28\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Inside the Fish Tank vs. Outside the Fish Tank\",\"overview\":\"In hopes of getting discovered as a singer, Seo Mok-ha recruits Jung Ki-ho to film a video. But as terror strikes both of them, they flee for a new life.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/64fveKHpRFSRamoVvOVELHczywo.jpg\",\"rating\":9.5,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-28\",\"runtime\":81},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Coincidence vs. Fate\",\"overview\":\"After a fortuitous rescue, Mok-ha reenters society with a little aid from Kang Woo-hak. Later, Mok-ha gets the chance to help her idol, Yoon Ran-joo.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9xeyR0cDCtp4ag9g3O6Ojdgqsp5.jpg\",\"rating\":9.8,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2023-10-29\",\"runtime\":67},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Cooler Box vs. Drone\",\"overview\":\"Ran-joo gets closer to Mok-ha — even getting her a chance to audition. But when the meeting doesn't go in their favor, Mok-ha devises another idea.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fEjAltDlIBNFlce9Z6g8u1tXeen.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-04\",\"runtime\":76},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"2008 vs. 2022\",\"overview\":\"Ran-joo performs on a television program, a singing competition with her past self. Mok-ha tries to get a message out to Ki-ho, hoping he's listening.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lJButhjgdlleanQwkcW6G3qZTZf.jpg\",\"rating\":9.8,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-05\",\"runtime\":67},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Regret vs. Pride\",\"overview\":\"After Mok-ha's frightening encounter with Ki-ho's father, Woo-hak begins investigating him. Mok-ha and Ran-joo get a chance to share the stage together.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y9TVIjXVvyEmGToTQOW210idCUp.jpg\",\"rating\":9.7,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-11\",\"runtime\":77},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Secrets vs. Lies\",\"overview\":\"Woo-hak learns the truth about his past from Kang Bo-geol. Mok-ha confronts Eun Mo-rae, the idol she could have been had she not been stranded.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dW7qorouIJo5GvmpV0bMFY2MtKy.jpg\",\"rating\":9.7,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-12\",\"runtime\":71},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Seo Mok-ha vs. Eun Mo-rae\",\"overview\":\"During a television program, Ran-joo makes a confession and forces Mok-ha to face off against Mo-rae. A threatening encounter compels Mok-ha to run away.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wYbMNfxX7IzJC30N9ZC4jXfGyQj.jpg\",\"rating\":9.7,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-18\",\"runtime\":74},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"First Fan vs. First Fan\",\"overview\":\"Bo-geol and Woo-hak retreive Mok-ha and take her on a camping trip with their family. Mok-ha tries to track down Ran-joo to make up for a mistake.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z8FohAXOhaCQIyqZG9CWjouhVg9.jpg\",\"rating\":9.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-19\",\"runtime\":74},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Consolation vs. Resolution\",\"overview\":\"Feeling the imminent threat of his father, Bo-geol confronts him first. After a tense exchange with Ran-joo, Mok-ha signs with RJ Entertainment.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6sOc3q4K9nWxt3qm34JXk9Wb6Z0.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-25\",\"runtime\":79},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Answers vs. Risks\",\"overview\":\"A scary encounter with Jung Bong-wan leads to Bo-geol's family getting bad press. Ran-joo asks Mok-ha to make a hard choice about her career.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jjnBapzaGQ6Ob8yurLQ2kGp9aua.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2023-11-26\",\"runtime\":75},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Giver vs. Taker\",\"overview\":\"Ran-joo and Mok-ha receive negative press after meeting with reporters. The Kang family interviews with the prosecutor in their case against Bong-wan.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ym6eJOtl4FTzOKBut26juHckQTk.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2023-12-02\",\"runtime\":77},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Coincidence vs. Fate\",\"overview\":\"Bong-wan executes his final attack on the Kang family. Mok-ha prepares to release her debut song — marking the beginning of her singing career.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wBIs1q9rRh519k4E1wQCaZbcBFJ.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2023-12-03\",\"runtime\":77}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2023-10-28\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}